  "description": {
    "text": "The Sun & Moon Trainer Kit: Lycanroc & Alolan Raichu, released on 21 April 2017, was the first kit of the Sun & Moon Series. Lycanroc and Alolan Raichu are new cards of the kit, as are Pikachu, Fletchling and Fletchinder; the rest are reprints. Besides the two half decks and their player's guides, the kit held damage counters, a rule book and an Alolan Raichu coin.\n\nThis set holds the Lycanroc half deck."
  },
